{
  "name": "Travel Tools MCP - Guest Services",
  "displayName": "Travel Tools MCP - Guest Services",
  "description": "Travel Guest Services: look up guests, reservations, room availability, folios and loyalty points; extend or cancel stays, change rooms, book amenities, post missing points, log complaints and credit folio charges (gateway limit $50). No property finance or revenue analytics.",
